          ('vol', T('환율 변동성 (연)', 'Exchange-rate volatility (yearly)'), 2, 20, 1, 8, T('클수록 환율이 요동쳐요. 캐리의 매력은 금리 차이÷변동성이에요', 'Higher means a wilder exchange rate. A carry\'s appeal is the gap divided by volatility')),
